<view class="learning-page"><view class="nav"><text class="back" bindtap="back">‹ 返回</text><text>平台管理</text><button bindtap="usage">平台费用</button></view><text class="title">供应商与模型</text><text class="sub">模型连接由内部网关管理。更换供应商模型时新增配置，已有会话继续使用原配置。</text><view class="card"><text class="card-title">添加供应商模型</text><input data-field="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="显示名称"/><input data-field="upstreamModel" value="{{upstreamModel}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="供应商/模型，例如 openai/模型标识"/><input data-field="baseURL" value="{{baseURL}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="API 地址，可留空使用供应商默认地址"/><input data-field="apiKey" value="{{apiKey}}" bindinput="input" password="{{true}}" placeholder="供应商 API 密钥"/><view class="row"><text>需要工具调用</text><switch checked="{{tools}}" data-field="tools" bindchange="toggle" color="#9b1f58"/><text>需要视觉输入</text><switch checked="{{vision}}" data-field="vision" bindchange="toggle" color="#9b1f58"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="create" loading="{{saving}}">保存模型连接</button><text class="error">{{error}}</text></view><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{models}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><text class="card-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="sub">{{item.upstream_model}} · {{item.enabled?'可用':'已停用'}}</text><text class="sub">能力验证：文字 {{item.capabilities.verified.text?'通过':'待验证'}} · 工具 {{item.capabilities.verified.tools?'通过':'待验证'}} · 视觉 {{item.capabilities.verified.vision?'通过':'待验证'}}</text><text class="sub">创建助手：{{settings.builderModelId===item.id?'当前默认':'—'}} · 视觉识别：{{settings.visionModelId===item.id?'当前默认':'—'}}</text><view class="actions"><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="text" bindtap="test">验证文字</button><button wx:if="{{item.capabilities.tools}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="tools" bindtap="test">验证工具</button><button wx:if="{{item.capabilities.vision}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="vision" bindtap="test">验证视觉</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="builderModelId" bindtap="setDefault">用于创建助手</button><button wx:if="{{item.capabilities.vision}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-field="visionModelId" bindtap="setDefault">用于图像识别</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-enabled="{{item.enabled}}" bindtap="enable">{{item.enabled?'停用':'启用'}}</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editKey">轮换密钥</button></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{editId}}" class="card"><text class="card-title">更新供应商密钥</text><input password="{{true}}" value="{{rotateKey}}" data-field="rotateKey" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="rotate">保存新密钥</button></view><view class="card"><text class="card-title">新增计费价格版本</text><text class="sub">模型价格按每百万 token，搜索按每 credit。历史记录使用当时的价格快照。</text><picker range="{{priceModels}}" range-key="name" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{priceModels[selected].name||'选择模型或服务'}}</view></picker><input value="{{currency}}" data-field="currency" bindinput="input" placeholder="币种，例如 USD"/><block wx:if="{{priceModels[selected].id!=='tavily'}}"><input value="{{inputPrice}}" data-field="inputPrice" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入单价 / 百万 token"/><input value="{{outputPrice}}" data-field="outputPrice" bindinput="input" placeholder="输出单价 / 百万 token"/><input value="{{cachedPrice}}" data-field="cachedPrice" bindinput="input" placeholder="缓存读取单价 / 百万 token，可留空"/></block><input wx:else value="{{creditPrice}}" data-field="creditPrice" bindinput="input" placeholder="每 credit 单价"/><button bindtap="price">保存价格版本</button><view wx:for="{{prices}}" wx:key="id"><text class="sub">{{item.modelName||item.model_id}} · {{item.currency}} · {{item.effective_at}}</text></view></view></view>